 front office made 37 transactions, 3 of them trades. [[p:4034|Christian McCaffrey]] was the league MVP. The club was renamed 6 times during the year, ending as Cooper Scoopers."},{"season":"2024","heading":"2024: Win one game","text":"Under Tony, Win one game went 6-8 to finish as the No. 8 seed, scoring 1626.72 points, 11th in the league. [[p:6797|Justin Herbert]] led the club with 257.36 points in 16 starts, followed by [[p:421|Matthew Stafford]] (214.58). The season high was 143.86 in week 3 ([[g:2024-03-1-4]]). In the Toilet Bowl they lost to [[f:12|Happy Feet]] 92.90-118.78 in the Toilet Bowl First Round, then beat [[f:7|young sexy central]] 100.06-96.38 in the Toilet Bowl Semifinal, then lost to [[f:11|BubbaNASTIES]] 93.00-134.26 in the Ninth Place Game and finished 10th. The front office made 45 transactions, 2 of them trades. The club was renamed 1 time during the year, ending as Win one game."},{"season":"2025","heading":"2025: Win one game","text":"Under Tony, Win one game went 3-11 to finish as the No. 11 seed, scoring 1412.14 points, 10th in the league. [[p:6797|Justin Herbert]] led the club with 249.43 points in 13 starts, followed by [[p:5872|Deebo Samuel]] (160.05). The season high was 129.00 in week 9 ([[g:2025-09-4-9]]). In the Toilet Bowl they beat [[f:2|Storm FC]] 115.28-85.40 in the Toilet Bowl Semifinal, then lost to [[f:11|BubbaNASTIES]] 80.70-172.98 in the Ninth Place Game and finished 10th. The front office made 50 transactions, 8 of them trades. The club was renamed 1 time during the year, ending as Im Stroud Of You."},{"season":"2026","heading":"2026: Im Stroud Of You","text":"Through 4 games under Tony, Im Stroud Of You are 1-3 and 11th in the standings, with 449.73 points (11th). [[p:9758|C.J. Stroud]] led the club with 69.14 points in 4 starts, followed by [[p:9487|Parker Washington]] (52.70). The season high was 124.22 in week 1 ([[g:2026-01-4-8]]). The front office made 16 transactions, 2 of them trades."}]}